---
title: How to Duplicate an Invoice?
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
**To duplicate a quotation:**

1. **Go to the “Invoices” section:**

   - **On the left sidebar, click on “Invoices” to view the list of invoices.**

1. **Select the invoice to duplicate:**

   - **Find the quotation you wish to duplicate from the list.**
   - **Click the ellipsis menu (…) next to the invoice.**

1. **Duplicate the invoice:**

   - **In the drop-down menu, click on “Duplicate Invoice.”.**
   - **A duplicate of the selected invoice will be created, and you can then edit or send the duplicated invoice as needed.**

**Alternatively, you can also access the “Duplicate Invoice” option within the Invoice details page under the “Save Invoice” dropdown.**
